    <string name="app_name" translatable="false">MelaMur</string>
    <string name="consent_title">Privacy &amp; location data</string>
    <string name="consent_text">MelaMur shows a map of Malta and helps you while riding the bus.\n\nWhat we collect: only while your phone sees the on-board network \"Tallinja Wi-Fi\", MelaMur switches on GPS and sends your position, speed and heading, together with a random trip identifier, to melamur.snel.it. No name, account, phone number or advertising ID is collected. When you leave the bus, GPS is switched off and collection stops.\n\nWhy: the positions of all participating riders are combined with bus stop and timetable data to build a more accurate live bus map of Malta (legal basis: your consent, Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR).\n\nRetention: raw positions are kept at most 30 days, after which only anonymous aggregates remain.\n\nYour rights: you can withdraw consent at any time via the Privacy button; the map keeps working without it. You have the right to access, rectification, erasure and to lodge a complaint with the Information and Data Protection Commissioner (IDPC, Malta). Controller contact: privacy@snel.it.</string>
